{"c":[{"name":"20261008T001204Z-bb38791614f982ff","text":"Caret app builds, including Debug, run scripts/privacy_gate.sh; helper/src/privacy/accepted.ts must record lead acceptance of pv2-sites-send and ha2-copied-conversation before builds pass, and CARET_DEV_VERCEL_GEMINI=1 is refused at build time.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T002947Z-c019705c5089f866","text":"The privacy gate also covers apps/caret/scripts/build-app.sh and direct helper bundling; onboarding must render generated Contents/Resources/PrivacyPromise.txt. Release child environments set CARET_RELEASE_HOST=1, which refuses every Vercel route even with a dev opt-in.","type":"note"}]}
